    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35185" root="قثرد" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُثْرُدٌ</span></b> , and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِثْرِدٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَثْرَدٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُثَارِدٌ</span></b>  <i>Household-goods,</i> or <i>utensils and furniture:</i> (K:) AA
says that <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُثْرُدٌ</span> has this signification: others say
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِثْرِدٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُثَارِدٌ</span></b> ; i. e., <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قرنشوش</span>. (IAar,
L.)

